[
   {
      "id":"11a578056fc3d56a",
      "type":"tab",
      "label":"CSS-SDA Simulation",
      "disabled":false,
      "info":"Simulates OPC UA servers from the CSS-SDA semantic mapping paper:\n\nExample A: Fermentation Skid (Skid-A1) — namespace 2\n  opc.tcp://192.168.10.5:4840\n  SignAndEncrypt / Basic256Sha256\n  Variables: Fermentation.TempSetpoint, Fermentation.TempActual, Fermentation.AgitatorSpeed\n             Dosing.FlowSetpoint, Dosing.VolumeActual\n\nExample B: HVAC Plant — namespace 3\n  AHU-01: opc.tcp://192.168.20.10:4840  Sign / Basic128Rsa15\n  EM-01:  opc.tcp://192.168.20.30:4840  SignAndEncrypt / Basic256Sha256\n  Variables: HVAC.AHU_TempSupply, HVAC.AHU_TempReturn, HVAC.AHU_AirFlow\n             Energy.ActivePower, Energy.EnergyTotal\n\nTest Variables (namespace 1) kept for backward compatibility.",
      "env":[]
   },
   {
      "id":"a16a28b2a3cb0758",
      "type":"comment",
      "z":"11a578056fc3d56a",
      "name":"Description — CSS-SDA OPC UA Simulation",
      "info":"This flow simulates the OPC UA servers described in the CSS-SDA semantic mapping paper.\n\nUse Case A (Fermentation Skid): Inject nodes add and update fermentation process variables in namespace 2.\nUse Case B (HVAC Plant): Inject nodes add and update HVAC/energy variables in namespace 3.\n\nClick a button to add a variable, then use the Set buttons to change its value.\nThe periodic simulation node auto-updates TempActual every 10 seconds.",
      "x":400,
      "y":40,
      "wires":[]
   },
